<%# Overrides Devise's default template, whose link points at the API's
    /api/v1/auth/password/edit — a route that only exists as JSON. The
    reset happens on the web app's /reset-password page instead. %>
<p>Hello <%= @resource.email %>,</p>

<p>Someone — hopefully you — asked to reset your BiteWorthy password.</p>

<p><a href="<%= Mailers::WebOrigin.reset_password_url(@token) %>" class="btn">Choose a new password</a></p>

<p>The link expires in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(Devise.reset_password_within) %>.
If you didn't ask for this, ignore this email — your password won't
change without the link being used.</p>
